  nonce: 6fcd  # 6fcd
  message: "The same shape in swift, filed 2026-11-01 as WI-nobup: protocol requirement members (methods and inits) are hard-coded is_exported=True at swift.py:1448-1450, so an internal protocol has exported members. Fix both languages by taking the container export."  # 6fcd
